there's a whole different
reason they're alcoholics.

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.380
Honestly, I'll just go
to that for a minute.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.820
Entrepreneurship is super lonely,

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:12.870
I hate that entrepreneurship is cool now

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.860
'cause people that are not
entrepreneurs are jumping in

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.250
and it is a dangerous, lonely game.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.730
If you're not a purebred,
you will get eaten up.

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.230
If you don't love losing
and love the struggle

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.060
and love the pushback, you will lose,

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.060
you will be unhappy but the reason

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.510
that a lot of entrepreneurs
are workaholics

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:30.470
is 'cause they love it, they got lucky.

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:33.935
They like literally love,
