00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.010
that are already counting down Friday

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:54.280
and that's not good and
that's not good for Chase

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.260
and that's not good
for them and so we need

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.620
a better debate and it starts

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.473
