00:19:01.928 --> 00:19:03.607
A lot of people are "Gary but how am I

00:19:03.607 --> 00:19:04.730
"supposed to live in New York City?"

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.240
I'm like, "Don't."

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.350
