00:24:39.740 --> 00:24:44.530
with the existing classroom
format of you have to go class

00:24:44.530 --> 00:24:46.900
for 45 minutes and take
English and then math

00:24:46.900 --> 00:24:50.470
and then science and they're struggling

00:24:50.470 --> 00:24:54.160
and it feels like it's a
broken education system,

00:24:54.160 --> 00:24:56.100
relative to where the world is moving

00:24:56.100 --> 00:24:58.760
and this entrepreneurial spirit,

00:24:58.760 --> 00:25:01.130
yet they still have no
choice but to go through it.

00:25:01.130 --> 00:25:04.937
So what advice do you give your kids?

00:25:04.937 --> 00:25:08.150
- Listen, I'm a hardcore D and F student,

00:25:08.150 --> 00:25:10.630
so I'm not interested in hypocrisy.

00:25:10.630 --> 00:25:13.530
My daughter who's 10 looks
like she's a big time student.

