And that's awesome, I have no
interest in frowning on that.

00:25:21.477 --> 00:25:24.240
I think that's great and as
long as that makes her happy

00:25:24.240 --> 00:25:26.690
and we have proper
conversations around that,

00:25:26.690 --> 00:25:28.890
I don't think my son's
gonna go exactly that route

00:25:28.890 --> 00:25:32.030
but for me, it's not about
demonizing the system.

